  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "人穷不可怕，脑子穷才真要命。看完这个矿山故事，你就明白了#穷人思维 #富人思维 #民间故事 #人生感悟 #励志正能量 #认知思维",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 230.876009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "从前，有个在码头扛大包过活的穷汉子，住在城东漏雨的窝棚里，天天天不亮就爬起来干活，累得腰都直不起来，可一家老小还是吃了上顿愁，下顿。他瞅着城里那个开粮铺的东家，天天坐在柜台后头喝茶算账，手指头都不用沾灰，银子却哗哗往里流。他心里越琢磨越窝火，觉着这老天爷太偏心了。这天夜里，穷汉子跪在土地庙跟前，哭诉一把鼻涕一把泪的说，自个儿命苦。没成想，真把巡夜的土地爷给惊动了土地爷笑呵呵，问他，那你说咋样才算公平？穷汉子磕头如捣蒜，求土地爷，把那个粮铺东家变得跟我一样穷干一样的活，他要是还能翻身，我这辈子再也不吭一声。土地爷点了点头，一挥手，那梁甫东家转眼就变成了跟穷汉子一模一样的打扮。破衣烂衫兜里比脸还干净，土地爷又给俩人各分了一座荒山。吩咐道，这山里有铁矿，你俩每天挖了矿，扛到镇上铁匠铺，卖了换钱。一个月之内，谁先把山上的铁矿石挖完，卖光，谁就能得到我指点。往后的财运不用愁，穷汉子扛大包出身，力气大的很，挖矿对他来说不算啥。头一天，他就挖了满满两筐铁矿，扛到镇上铁匠铺，换了几块碎银子，转头就全买了白面和大肉，回家给婆娘娃娃炖了一锅喷香的肉汤。那梁铺东家细皮嫩肉的从没干过重活，抡了几下镐头，手心就磨出了血泡，气喘吁吁歇了好几回，天黑透才勉强凑够一筐矿。换了碎银子以后，他没敢大手大脚，只买了几个窝窝头垫肚子，剩下的钱一文没动，揣了起来。第二天一早，穷汉子又吭哧吭哧上山挖矿去了。心里光想着多挖点，多换点好吃的。可那粮铺东家压根儿没上山，反而揣着昨天省下的碎银子，跑到镇上找了两个闲汉给他们工钱，让帮忙挖矿。他自己搬了个小马扎，坐在树底下时不时吆喝两声，指点几句，一点力气都不用出，就一上午的功夫，两个咸汉就挖了满满六大筐，铁矿石东家拉着矿石去铁匠铺卖掉，转头又雇了四个壮劳力。一天下来，刨去给工人们的工钱。他兜里剩的银子比穷汉子累死累活挖一天矿赚的还多出好几倍。一个月眨眼就过完了，穷汉子天天挖矿换钱，买吃的，手里几乎没存下啥余钱，山上的铁矿才挖了一小脚。可能梁浦东家呢早就靠雇人，把整座山的铁矿挖的干干净净，赚了一大笔钱，拿着钱在镇上盘了间铺面，倒腾起铁器买卖来了。没过多久，又成了有钱人，穷汉子，瞅着这一切，再也不抱怨，老天不公了。这个故事告诉咱们富人富在脑子不再力气，真正的大钱从来不是靠死干硬干政来的，是靠你的想法和眼界赚来的。人穷不可怕，可怕的是脑子穷人穷穷，一时脑子穷穷一世。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "从前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00002",
      "start_ms": 610,
      "end_ms": 3810,
      "text": "有个在码头扛大包过活的穷汉子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4130,
      "end_ms": 6210,
      "text": "住在城东漏雨的窝棚里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6490,
      "end_ms": 8530,
      "text": "天天天不亮就爬起来干活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8770,
      "end_ms": 10150,
      "text": "累得腰都直不起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10690,
      "end_ms": 13050,
      "text": "可一家老小还是吃了上顿愁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13050,
      "end_ms": 13570,
      "text": "下顿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14150,
      "end_ms": 16490,
      "text": "他瞅着城里那个开粮铺的东家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16970,
      "end_ms": 19430,
      "text": "天天坐在柜台后头喝茶算账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19810,
      "end_ms": 21350,
      "text": "手指头都不用沾灰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21650,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "银子却哗哗往里流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24050,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "他心里越琢磨越窝火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26430,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "觉着这老天爷太偏心了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29230,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "这天夜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30940,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "穷汉子跪在土地庙跟前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33100,
      "end_ms": 35300,
      "text": "哭诉一把鼻涕一把泪的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35300,
      "end_ms": 36040,
      "text": "自个儿命苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36700,
      "end_ms": 37420,
      "text": "没成想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00019",
      "start_ms": 37420,
      "end_ms": 41640,
      "text": "真把巡夜的土地爷给惊动了土地爷笑呵呵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41640,
      "end_ms": 42040,
      "text": "问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00021",
      "start_ms": 42980,
      "end_ms": 44840,
      "text": "那你说咋样才算公平？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45780,
      "end_ms": 47420,
      "text": "穷汉子磕头如捣蒜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47900,
      "end_ms": 48740,
      "text": "求土地爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00024",
      "start_ms": 48980,
      "end_ms": 53240,
      "text": "把那个粮铺东家变得跟我一样穷干一样的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00025",
      "start_ms": 54100,
      "end_ms": 55500,
      "text": "他要是还能翻身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00026",
      "start_ms": 55920,
      "end_ms": 57840,
      "text": "我这辈子再也不吭一声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00027",
      "start_ms": 58920,
      "end_ms": 60285,
      "text": "土地爷点了点头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00028",
      "start_ms": 60570,
      "end_ms": 61225,
      "text": "一挥手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00029",
      "start_ms": 61790,
      "end_ms": 66170,
      "text": "那梁甫东家转眼就变成了跟穷汉子一模一样的打扮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00030",
      "start_ms": 66230,
      "end_ms": 68305,
      "text": "破衣烂衫兜里比脸还干净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68710,
      "end_ms": 70905,
      "text": "土地爷又给俩人各分了一座荒山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00032",
      "start_ms": 71150,
      "end_ms": 71785,
      "text": "吩咐道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72410,
      "end_ms": 73715,
      "text": "这山里有铁矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00034",
      "start_ms": 74080,
      "end_ms": 75240,
      "text": "你俩每天挖了矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00035",
      "start_ms": 75480,
      "end_ms": 76900,
      "text": "扛到镇上铁匠铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00036",
      "start_ms": 76920,
      "end_ms": 77745,
      "text": "卖了换钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00037",
      "start_ms": 78350,
      "end_ms": 79335,
      "text": "一个月之内，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00038",
      "start_ms": 79710,
      "end_ms": 82290,
      "text": "谁先把山上的铁矿石挖完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00039",
      "start_ms": 82290,
      "end_ms": 82905,
      "text": "卖光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00040",
      "start_ms": 83370,
      "end_ms": 85025,
      "text": "谁就能得到我指点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00041",
      "start_ms": 85790,
      "end_ms": 87745,
      "text": "往后的财运不用愁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00042",
      "start_ms": 88750,
      "end_ms": 90685,
      "text": "穷汉子扛大包出身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00043",
      "start_ms": 91020,
      "end_ms": 91835,
      "text": "力气大的很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00044",
      "start_ms": 92340,
      "end_ms": 94405,
      "text": "挖矿对他来说不算啥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00045",
      "start_ms": 94910,
      "end_ms": 95510,
      "text": "头一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00046",
      "start_ms": 95510,
      "end_ms": 97815,
      "text": "他就挖了满满两筐铁矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00047",
      "start_ms": 98250,
      "end_ms": 99910,
      "text": "扛到镇上铁匠铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00048",
      "start_ms": 99910,
      "end_ms": 101290,
      "text": "换了几块碎银子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00049",
      "start_ms": 101390,
      "end_ms": 103845,
      "text": "转头就全买了白面和大肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00050",
      "start_ms": 104180,
      "end_ms": 107495,
      "text": "回家给婆娘娃娃炖了一锅喷香的肉汤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00051",
      "start_ms": 107980,
      "end_ms": 111525,
      "text": "那梁铺东家细皮嫩肉的从没干过重活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00052",
      "start_ms": 111970,
      "end_ms": 113070,
      "text": "抡了几下镐头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00053",
      "start_ms": 113090,
      "end_ms": 115005,
      "text": "手心就磨出了血泡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00054",
      "start_ms": 115540,
      "end_ms": 117305,
      "text": "气喘吁吁歇了好几回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00055",
      "start_ms": 118080,
      "end_ms": 121615,
      "text": "天黑透才勉强凑够一筐矿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00056",
      "start_ms": 122460,
      "end_ms": 123700,
      "text": "换了碎银子以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00057",
      "start_ms": 123700,
      "end_ms": 125095,
      "text": "他没敢大手大脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00058",
      "start_ms": 125820,
      "end_ms": 127905,
      "text": "只买了几个窝窝头垫肚子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00059",
      "start_ms": 128700,
      "end_ms": 130280,
      "text": "剩下的钱一文没动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00060",
      "start_ms": 130420,
      "end_ms": 131245,
      "text": "揣了起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00061",
      "start_ms": 131750,
      "end_ms": 132550,
      "text": "第二天一早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00062",
      "start_ms": 132710,
      "end_ms": 135370,
      "text": "穷汉子又吭哧吭哧上山挖矿去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00063",
      "start_ms": 135370,
      "end_ms": 137070,
      "text": "心里光想着多挖点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00064",
      "start_ms": 137090,
      "end_ms": 138335,
      "text": "多换点好吃的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00065",
      "start_ms": 139020,
      "end_ms": 141200,
      "text": "可那粮铺东家压根儿没上山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00066",
      "start_ms": 141460,
      "end_ms": 143985,
      "text": "反而揣着昨天省下的碎银子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00067",
      "start_ms": 144430,
      "end_ms": 147810,
      "text": "跑到镇上找了两个闲汉给他们工钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00068",
      "start_ms": 147930,
      "end_ms": 148995,
      "text": "让帮忙挖矿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00069",
      "start_ms": 149550,
      "end_ms": 151030,
      "text": "他自己搬了个小马扎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00070",
      "start_ms": 151150,
      "end_ms": 153690,
      "text": "坐在树底下时不时吆喝两声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00071",
      "start_ms": 153690,
      "end_ms": 154555,
      "text": "指点几句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00072",
      "start_ms": 154960,
      "end_ms": 156355,
      "text": "一点力气都不用出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00073",
      "start_ms": 156910,
      "end_ms": 158345,
      "text": "就一上午的功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00074",
      "start_ms": 158800,
      "end_ms": 161340,
      "text": "两个咸汉就挖了满满六大筐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00075",
      "start_ms": 161340,
      "end_ms": 165440,
      "text": "铁矿石东家拉着矿石去铁匠铺卖掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00076",
      "start_ms": 165780,
      "end_ms": 168475,
      "text": "转头又雇了四个壮劳力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00077",
      "start_ms": 169750,
      "end_ms": 170570,
      "text": "一天下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00078",
      "start_ms": 170710,
      "end_ms": 172625,
      "text": "刨去给工人们的工钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00079",
      "start_ms": 172920,
      "end_ms": 177965,
      "text": "他兜里剩的银子比穷汉子累死累活挖一天矿赚的还多出好几倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00080",
      "start_ms": 178400,
      "end_ms": 180245,
      "text": "一个月眨眼就过完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00081",
      "start_ms": 180630,
      "end_ms": 182470,
      "text": "穷汉子天天挖矿换钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00082",
      "start_ms": 182470,
      "end_ms": 183195,
      "text": "买吃的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00083",
      "start_ms": 183690,
      "end_ms": 185595,
      "text": "手里几乎没存下啥余钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00084",
      "start_ms": 186120,
      "end_ms": 188235,
      "text": "山上的铁矿才挖了一小脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00085",
      "start_ms": 189020,
      "end_ms": 192045,
      "text": "可能梁浦东家呢早就靠雇人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00086",
      "start_ms": 192450,
      "end_ms": 195525,
      "text": "把整座山的铁矿挖的干干净净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00087",
      "start_ms": 195820,
      "end_ms": 196995,
      "text": "赚了一大笔钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00088",
      "start_ms": 197470,
      "end_ms": 199795,
      "text": "拿着钱在镇上盘了间铺面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00089",
      "start_ms": 200310,
      "end_ms": 202345,
      "text": "倒腾起铁器买卖来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00090",
      "start_ms": 203240,
      "end_ms": 204275,
      "text": "没过多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00091",
      "start_ms": 205010,
      "end_ms": 206375,
      "text": "又成了有钱人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00092",
      "start_ms": 206640,
      "end_ms": 207240,
      "text": "穷汉子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00093",
      "start_ms": 207240,
      "end_ms": 208135,
      "text": "瞅着这一切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00094",
      "start_ms": 208550,
      "end_ms": 209370,
      "text": "再也不抱怨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00095",
      "start_ms": 209370,
      "end_ms": 210285,
      "text": "老天不公了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00096",
      "start_ms": 211010,
      "end_ms": 215480,
      "text": "这个故事告诉咱们富人富在脑子不再力气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00097",
      "start_ms": 215680,
      "end_ms": 220035,
      "text": "真正的大钱从来不是靠死干硬干政来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00098",
      "start_ms": 220630,
      "end_ms": 223205,
      "text": "是靠你的想法和眼界赚来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00099",
      "start_ms": 223780,
      "end_ms": 225005,
      "text": "人穷不可怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00100",
      "start_ms": 225400,
      "end_ms": 228510,
      "text": "可怕的是脑子穷人穷穷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3a99cb8f56df9807_s00101",
      "start_ms": 228510,
      "end_ms": 230725,
      "text": "一时脑子穷穷一世。"
    }
  ],
